GET https://web.cyanide-studio.com/ws/bb3/halloffame/?league=NAF BB3 Kickoff&limit=10&platform=pc&key={{apiKey}}

### Get ladder
GET https://web.cyanide-studio.com/ws/bb3/ladder/?league=NAF BB3 Kickoff&limit=100&platform=pc&key={{apiKey}}
